<title>ITALY: SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-12-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in Italian first</p>
<p>division after matches on Sunday:</p>
<p>8 - Abel Balbo (Roma), Felippo Inzaghi (Atalanta), Pasquale</p>
<p>Luiso (Piacenza)</p>
<p>7 - George Weah (Milan)</p>
<p>6 - Oliver Bierhoff (Udinese), Roberto Mancini (Sampdoria),</p>
<p>Marcello Otero (Vicenza)</p>
<p>5 - Alfredo Aglietti (Napoli), Gabriel Batistuta (Fiorentina),</p>
<p>Enrico Chiesa (Parma), Igor Kolyvanov (Bologna), Giuseppe</p>
<p>Signori (Lazio)</p>
<p>4 - Roberto Baggio (Milan), Nicola Caccia (Napoli), Youri</p>
<p>Djorkaeff (Inter), Paolo Poggi (Udinese), Luis Oliveira</p>
<p>(Fiorentina), Sandro Tovalieri (Reggiana)</p>
</text>
